msgid "Selection Window"
msgstr "Ventana d'esbilla"

#: kmagselrect.cpp:208 main.cpp:39
msgid "KMagnifier"
msgstr "KMagnifier"

#: kmagzoomview.cpp:126
msgid ""
"This is the main window which shows the contents of the selected region. The "
"contents will be magnified according to the zoom level that is set."
msgstr ""
"Ésta ye la ventana principal qu'amuesa'l conteníu del área esbillao. El "
"conteníu amosaráse enantáu si afitó un nivel d'ampliación."

#: main.cpp:40
msgid "Screen magnifier for the K Desktop Environment (KDE)"
msgstr "Llupa de la pantalla pal entornu d'escritoriu K (KDE)"

